cff-version: 1.2.0
# This file describes the current public-facing project release. The immutable v0.1.0 tag carries
# its own historical CITATION.cff under the old project name `jev-test`; that file is not rewritten.
message: >-
  Cite v0.1.1 for the current jev-testbench Publication Closure state. If your claim depends on the
  frozen Jev measurements, cite v0.1.0 as the scientific evidence anchor: 42 core records plus 12 P3
  records, unchanged by this release.
title: "jev-testbench: a lightweight Jev testbench built through Agentic Engineering"
abstract: >-
  Publication Closure for jev-testbench: a lightweight TypeSafe Jev exploratory testbench, its
  auditable evidence trail, a preregistered null attribution result, an Agentic Engineering process
  record, and a human-approved bilingual technical blog. This release adds no new Jev API calls,
  experiments, measurements, or scientific claims. The immutable v0.1.0 tag remains the scientific
  evidence freeze and preserves the historical project name jev-test. The carried-forward scientific
  state is NO_STRONG_JEV_SPECIFIC_NOVEL_FINDING_YET and P3_KILL_NO_SINGLE_FIELD_ATTRIBUTION.
